[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; zone_ridge — the spider desert (WLD-05; built for the map themes, 2026-09-23), band 11–15.
;
; Past the orc valley the land dries out into sand and red rock. A trail crosses it west to east.
; Spiderlings hatch in the west among webbed rocks, sand spiders hunt the dunes, adders and
; cactoro hold the ruins of an old temple in the north, and the oasis in the south is theirs too.
; The spider queen breeds them in a crater of rock at the north-east — the lair has one way in.
; Three webbed stones, the map's shards, stand south-west, north and south-east.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and clutter are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act1.json. This file is
; coordinates. Generated by a script; edit the script, not this file.

